To make things simpler this will extract the handshake packets and output to a new pcap file

tshark -r capture.cap -Y "eapol.type == 3" -w handshake.cap -F pcap

Perform a dictionary attack to get the password.

aircrack-ng handshake.pcap -w wordlist.txt,wordlist2.txt

or use hashcat for GPU acceleration

(coming soon)
hcxpcapngtool -o (file.pcapng) input.cap
hashcat -a 0 -D 1,2 -m 22000 (cap) (wordlist)
